                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">In this transformative project, convergence researchers, children (aged 8-12 years) and (mental) health care professionals explored these three challenges. The main objective was to create a roadmap to a convergence <i>child research hub: </i>a transdisciplinary and cooperative network aiming to promote and support child participation in convergence research on wellbeing.</p>"
